      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The issue here might have to do with the certificate for Twitch itself, which is not signed by the Amazon Root CA 1. Here is what worked for me. YMMV.\n\n1. Browse to twitch(.)tv\n\n2. Download/Export the certificate.\n\n3. Install the Twitch leaf certificate to the local system and user, install the complete chain if required.\n\n4. (I installed the Amazon Root CA 1 as well, so maybe that does help as well)\n\n5. Access Internet Options > Content > Clear SSL State\n\n6. Reboot",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
