      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{62df14bc67455d44a154decc|full_name} The HLS playlist URLs (what yt-dlp resolves when entering a link to a live stream) are from a different domain that has a different certificate chain. Usually is something like https :// video-weaver.mil02.hls.ttvnw.net/v1/playlist/CoMasdasdefdeeead<etc> \n\nThat is why clips and vods would work for people vs live streams, as clips and vods are not hosted on hls ttvnw net, just the playlist files. (this domain btw is not listed in the default video player allowlist https://creators.vrchat.com/worlds/udon/video-players/www-whitelist/ )",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
